{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2015-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1448236800, "end_date": 1448927999, "month_true_total": 1023, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:53:43 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "19400516", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066825762", "personaname": "fenderbender541", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198066825762/", "num_games_owned": 22, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 13555, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13351, "last_played": 1443650212, "avatar": "1f55060d5600e66278c2d1958a36d9386f85ba17"}, "language": "english", "review": "Do you like games?\nDo you have no life?\nDo you have no money to buy games and DLC?\nIf you said yes to any of these questions, you may have a problem and your friends are there for you.\nThis game is so good that people want to buy premium currency.  Premium currancy isn't even a roadblock because nearly everything is unlockable in game.  Free updates add extra content and the developers are active with the game's community with their own \"Lets play\" and dev streams.  I have played this on PC and console and have spent more time on this game than all my Skyrim accounts combined! Would and have recommended to everyone i know.", "timestamp_created": 1448927458, "timestamp_updated": 1448927458, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19400237", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009027371", "personaname": "Volgan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/seanvolgan/", "num_games_owned": 408, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 78111, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 25464, "last_played": 1784961240, "avatar": "d392cafcf81096627b32ea0d19b01b15f3ccfa12"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10 - Bottom line its free to play, and worth a download. Warframe is one of the best games I've played in awhile. Game is constantly getting new content to keep players loving it. Its artstyle, graphics, and combat system are keeping up with the times. Community isn't bad and Dev's constantly take feedback from players.", "timestamp_created": 1448926262, "timestamp_updated": 1448926262, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19400178", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095558515", "personaname": "Thatssomark", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198095558515/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4113, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2779, "last_played": 1498797098, "avatar": "53860fb7e64457191b1fdb6f57662dbb40e9957d"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is like Destiny's cooler cousin that you want to hang out with for 4 days.", "timestamp_created": 1448926046, "timestamp_updated": 1448926046, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.488826841115951538", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19399415", "author": {"steamid": "76561198096409557", "personaname": "Sheesha", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Khwarizmi/", "num_games_owned": 42, "num_reviews": 3, "playtim